  "description": "Choi Kang is really a soft-hearted guy, despite his completely opposite looks. He is determined to make friends at school, but Haessal wrongfully gets the impression that he's a bully. Kang's online friend \"Bada-nim\" consoles him, as he tries to clear up the misunderstanding. Will he succeed? And what will happen to him and Haessal? \n\n(Source: Hour of Lunacy)",
